      "paperId": "5d0dc357c5f0438dfff2aa5c7396197416da0281",
      "title": "A Voice Sweeter than Salt: Toyin Falola and the Construction of Subaltern Narrative Space",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Ben Weiss",
